<http://data.silknow.org/object/6722227e-4ea8-365b-8ac0-fbeccce5b887>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of woven silk twill.\nHussein Kuli Khan type. Seamed vertically down the centre.\nDark blue ground with an incomplete design. There is the lower part of a large boteh. It has a red border edged with orange and filled with white flower heads outlined in dark blue. There is a pair of green curled leaves and above these is a white vase from which comes a spray of pink flowers with white outlines and orange stems. The inner edge of the boteh is lined with pink flowers with orange outlines. At  the upper edge of the piece the boteh contains what appears to be a semi-circular wreath or swag. There is a partial boteh down the left hand side and two small right-facing botehs on the diagonal: these have a red ground with white floral decoration and an orange serrated outline.\nWarp: dark blue silk.\nWeft: white, orange, red, green, light blue, dark blue silk."@en , "Dress fabric of woven silk twill, Iran, 1860-1899"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/1324c5c7-2b10-3359-a9ba-b7251d5b0f27> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of woven silk twill, Iran, 1860-1899"@en , "Dress fabric of woven silk twill.\nHussein Kuli Khan type. Seamed vertically down the centre.\nDark blue ground with an incomplete design. There is the lower part of a large boteh. It has a red border edged with orange and filled with white flower heads outlined in dark blue. There is a pair of green curled leaves and above these is a white vase from which comes a spray of pink flowers with white outlines and orange stems. The inner edge of the boteh is lined with pink flowers with orange outlines. At  the upper edge of the piece the boteh contains what appears to be a semi-circular wreath or swag. There is a partial boteh down the left hand side and two small right-facing botehs on the diagonal: these have a red ground with white floral decoration and an orange serrated outline.\nWarp: dark blue silk.\nWeft: white, orange, red, green, light blue, dark blue silk."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/6722227e-4ea8-365b-8ac0-fbeccce5b887/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/6722227e-4ea8-365b-8ac0-fbeccce5b887/dimension/2> ;
